# Rules

**Base rules** at `../../.cursor/rules/` (parent workspace) — shared across all workspaces via Cursor parent-directory traversal.
**Workspace `_ws` rules** here — project-specific extensions.

## Rule Placement

| Content | Location | Naming | Apply mode |
|---------|----------|--------|------------|
| Language patterns (Python, JS, PHP) | `/mnt/torus/projects/.cursor/rules/` | `{topic}.mdc` | Glob-matched |
| Universal workflow/quality | `/mnt/torus/projects/.cursor/rules/` | `{topic}.mdc` | Always apply |
| Project topology, services, hosts | Workspace `.cursor/rules/` | `{topic}_ws.mdc` | Always apply |
| Project-specific domain patterns | Workspace `.cursor/rules/` | `{topic}_ws.mdc` | Glob-matched |

**Decision**: generic (any project) ⟹ parent `../../.cursor/rules/`. References this project's services/hosts/domain ⟹ workspace `_ws.mdc`.

## Always Applied — Base (from parent)

Engineering invariants that apply to any code work in this repo, no
cortex/team-collab coupling.

| Rule | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `system.mdc` | Assistant guidelines |
| `provenance-discipline.mdc` | Completion-claim discipline — quote tool-response payloads, never narrate done |
| `advisor-timing.mdc` | Four checkpoints for consulting higher-tier reasoning |
| `model-tier-stub.mdc` | Tiny entry-point stub — fires loading of full model-tier-awareness on triggers |

## Always Applied — Workspace

| Rule | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `core_ws.mdc` | Environment, logs, ecosystem, workflow extensions |
| `md-navigation_ws.mdc` | Markdown section ops — md_list/md_read before any large .md/.mdc read |
