## On-Demand — Cortex / agent-bus / team-collab stack

These rules are `alwaysApply: false`. Default Cursor sessions stay code-focused;
this stack loads only when explicitly invoked.

### Load on `/cortex-boot` (or first `/agent-bus` invocation per session)

Workspace:
- `cursor-environment_ws.mdc` — IDE environment briefing
- `mcp-tool-awareness_ws.mdc` — `CallMcpTool` / fs md ops conventions
- `awareness_ws.mdc` — todo + vision + discovery awareness
- `mcp-debugging-ux_ws.mdc` — Event Service / observability UX

Parent:
- `../.cursor/rules/cortex-essentials.mdc` — cortex CRUD basics
- `../.cursor/rules/architecture-handoff-protocol.mdc` — handoff packet contract
- `../.cursor/rules/handoff-dispatchers.mdc` — dispatcher capability matrix

### Load on `/session-end`

- `../.cursor/rules/session-close.mdc`
- `../.cursor/rules/session-transcript-fidelity.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/session-transcript-fidelity_ws.mdc`
- `../.cursor/rules/cortex-essentials.mdc` (if not yet loaded)
- `../.cursor/rules/cortex-deep-ref.mdc`

### Load on Plan-mode entry / Task subagent launch

- `../.cursor/rules/testing-discipline.mdc` — when checklist includes migration/registry pytest deliverables
- `../.cursor/rules/testing_ws.mdc` — same session if ULG paths/commands needed
- `../.cursor/rules/workflow/plan-mode.mdc` — entering Plan mode
- `../.cursor/rules/workflow/subagent-strategy.mdc` — before launching a Task subagent

